      "id": "CVE-2026-133484",
      "publishedDate": "2026-11-20T04:15:15.678Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-11-20T04:15:15.678Z",
      "description": "A vulnerability was found in ByteDance Lark Desktop 8.0.0.14. This vulnerability affects the function FUN_18001b770/FUN_18001ba40 in the library backend.dll. Performing a manipulation of the argument day results in signed to unsigned conversion error. The attack needs to be approached locally. The exploit has been made public and could be used. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.",
      "severity": 5.3,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：ByteDance Lark Desktop\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
